## Import and adoption

Import uses the natural component/provider identity:

{{ codefile "shell" .ImportFile }}

Pulse never returns an existing plaintext credential, so import cannot
populate `secret`. Configure a new `rotation_trigger` and apply to rotate
immediately.

If the imported integration is human-owned, also set `adopt = true`. Adoption
is explicit because it transfers lifecycle ownership to automation and rotates
the credential atomically. The UI cannot rotate an automation-owned
integration afterward.
